   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Prerequisites, az sign-in, configuration and name\nchecks, permissions, model capacity. Then the plan\ntable (run, done or skip per step, with estimates) and\nwhat the run will change. -CheckOnly (alias -DryRun)\nstops here: strictly read-only, it also compiles the\ntemplates when Bicep is installed; exit 3 if blocked,\nelse 0.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "d10_0035",
   "originalText": "Prerequisites, az sign-in, configuration and name\nchecks, permissions, model capacity. Then the plan\ntable (run, done or skip per step, with estimates) and\nwhat the run will change. -CheckOnly (alias -DryRun)\nstops here: strictly read-only, it also compiles the\ntemplates when Bicep is installed; exit 3 if blocked,\nelse 0.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
