   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A plain loop over the plan, never parallel. A step\nstarts only when its needed files exist (otherwise a\nrequired step stops the run and an optional one is\nskipped). Up to 3 attempts, only for transient errors,\n60 s apart (90 s for governance). Exit 0 with its file\nmissing counts as failed. A failed required step (1-17)\nstops the run; a failed optional step (18-26) only\nwarns.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "d10_0047",
   "originalText": "A plain loop over the plan, never parallel. A step\nstarts only when its needed files exist (otherwise a\nrequired step stops the run and an optional one is\nskipped). Up to 3 attempts, only for transient errors,\n60 s apart (90 s for governance). Exit 0 with its file\nmissing counts as failed. A failed required step (1-17)\nstops the run; a failed optional step (18-26) only\nwarns.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
