   "text": "identity\\Use-AdminAsPersona.ps1 -As wes -Also tara\nRole baseline: the signed-in admin mirrors the roles\nand groups of wes and tara, so agent beats, which\nrun as the operator, have them before the first\nconsent.\nneeds: entra.json\nwrites: roles and groups in Entra, no file\nest. 1-2 min",
