   "text": "scripts\\foundry-connections.ps1\n6 Foundry connections (5 OAuth, 1 legacy key), then\nregisters the Foundry redirect URLs on the agent\nclient.\nneeds: entra.json, apis.json, apps.json, foundry.json\nand the agent-client secret\nwrites: connections.json\nest. 5-10 min",
