   "originalText": "scripts\\deploy.ps1 -Stage governance\nPolicy initiative and assignment, exemptions, the\nguardrail abw-agent-guardrails, diagnostics; then the\nobservability pack: KQL function pack, 9 Sentinel\nrules, Cockpit workbook, 3 ops alerts (-Stage\nobservability re-runs only the pack). Retries after 90 s\nif a role assignment has not propagated.\nneeds: foundry.json, platform.json\nwrites: governance.json, observability.json,\npolicy.json\nest. 8-12 min",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
