   "text": "scripts\\jumpbox-console.ps1\nInstalls the Demo Console on the VM: tools, package,\nvenv, launcher, verify. Persona files only with\n-IncludePersonaFiles.\nneeds: jumpbox.json\nwrites: jumpbox.json (consoleOnVm)\nest. 15-25 min\noff with -SkipJumpBox or -SkipConsole; skipped if\ndemo\\evidence-scrubbed\\scoreboard.json is missing",
