   "text": "scripts\\extras-agent-identity.ps1\n-SkipConditionalAccess\nRecords the Entra Agent ID and grants the Agent 365\ngateway role on APIM. The script alone also creates\nONE report-only Conditional Access policy; the\norchestrator skips it.\nneeds: apim.json, entra.json\nwrites: trackb-identity.json\nest. 1-3 min\noff by default: add -WithExtras",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "d10_0207",
   "originalText": "scripts\\extras-agent-identity.ps1\n-SkipConditionalAccess\nRecords the Entra Agent ID and grants the Agent 365\ngateway role on APIM. The script alone also creates\nONE report-only Conditional Access policy; the\norchestrator skips it.\nneeds: apim.json, entra.json\nwrites: trackb-identity.json\nest. 1-3 min\noff by default: add -WithExtras",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
