   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "priya, wes and tara each enrol an authenticator secret once: about 12 min each; the\nwhole one-time manual prep is about 40 min. identity\\Persona-Totp.py stores the secret\nand produces the codes.\nPath B needs none of it: the admin mirrors a persona\n(identity\\Use-AdminAsPersona.ps1; step 14 does it for wes and tara).\nWhen: after step 2, once the users exist.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "d10_0278",
   "originalText": "priya, wes and tara each enrol an authenticator secret once: about 12 min each; the\nwhole one-time manual prep is about 40 min. identity\\Persona-Totp.py stores the secret\nand produces the codes.\nPath B needs none of it: the admin mirrors a persona\n(identity\\Use-AdminAsPersona.ps1; step 14 does it for wes and tara).\nWhen: after step 2, once the users exist.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
