   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Three admin-portal switches: the Agent 365 gateway (the tenant-level consent),\nDefender XDR 'Security for AI agents' and Purview 'DSPM for AI'. Click-paths:\ndocs\\DEMO-GUIDE.md, section A6. Teardown does not reverse them.\nWhen: optional, no fixed place in the order.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "d10_0290",
   "originalText": "Three admin-portal switches: the Agent 365 gateway (the tenant-level consent),\nDefender XDR 'Security for AI agents' and Purview 'DSPM for AI'. Click-paths:\ndocs\\DEMO-GUIDE.md, section A6. Teardown does not reverse them.\nWhen: optional, no fixed place in the order.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
