   "locked": false,
   "text": "-WhatIf prints everything it would remove and deletes nothing. -Yes skips the type-the-resource-group-name prompt.\n-KeepEntra skips 0 and 6, -SkipPurge skips 4, -CleanLocal adds 7. It only touches objects it can prove belong to the\ndemo.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "-WhatIf prints everything it would remove and deletes nothing. -Yes skips the type-the-resource-group-name prompt.\n-KeepEntra skips 0 and 6, -SkipPurge skips 4, -CleanLocal adds 7. It only touches objects it can prove belong to the\ndemo.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d10_0337",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1490.0,
   "y": 2867.0,
   "width": 335.22,
   "height": 20.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
