   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 35607990,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- Each step's result is a file in infra\\generated. A step starts only when the files it needs exist, a failed required step (1-17) stops the run, and rerunning the same command resumes where it\n  stopped.\n- The one command wraps the machine steps only. Persona MFA, OAuth consents, the admin-portal switches and the VM sign-in stay with people (grey H markers).\n- Two ordering rules: create_agents.py runs twice, because the guardrail step (18) needs the guardrail that governance (17) creates; and the role baseline (14) must exist before the first OAuth\n  consent (H2). API Management (est. 35-50 min) dominates the run time.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- Each step's result is a file in infra\\generated. A step starts only when the files it needs exist, a failed required step (1-17) stops the run, and rerunning the same command resumes where it\n  stopped.\n- The one command wraps the machine steps only. Persona MFA, OAuth consents, the admin-portal switches and the VM sign-in stay with people (grey H markers).\n- Two ordering rules: create_agents.py runs twice, because the guardrail step (18) needs the guardrail that governance (17) creates; and the role baseline (14) must exist before the first OAuth\n  consent (H2). API Management (est. 35-50 min) dominates the run time.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
